# The fuzz target imports doc_firewall.scanner, which eagerly loads these
# runtime deps. They are duplicated from pyproject.toml [project.dependencies]
# on purpose: dependabot re-resolves this file from the .in alone and dropped
# the whole tree to just atheris in PR #115, breaking the nightly fuzz job.
# Listing them here keeps regenerations self-sufficient. Versions stay aligned
# via the -c constraint above. Keep in sync with pyproject.toml.
numpy
python-docx
openpyxl
defusedxml
structlog
pydantic
pydantic-settings
filelock
